# LIBM-F32-GAMMA (D-10.3): Γ(5/2 + s) on [-1/2, 1/2], the reduced range of the `float` gamma kernel
# after Γ(x) = Γ(t)·(x - 1)···t or Γ(t)/(x (x + 1)···(t - 1)) with t = x - n in [2, 3) and s = t - 5/2
# (exact). Relative error: Γ has no zero on [2, 3].
name = fast32_tgamma
target = tgamma_2p5
interval = -1/2, 1/2
powers = 0..14
error = relative
format = f64
output = crates/math/src/coeffs/fast32_tgamma.rs
